384
00:20:34,640 --> 00:20:35,570
Forty-six days.

385
00:20:37,290 --> 00:20:38,590
Do you know why

386
00:20:38,590 --> 00:20:39,400
I kept wanting to ask you

387
00:20:39,400 --> 00:20:41,060
