469
00:24:10,480 --> 00:24:11,540
I can't control it.

470
00:24:16,750 --> 00:24:18,010
It's your home.

471
00:24:19,090 --> 00:24:19,680
Lili.

472
00:24:20,610 --> 00:24:21,110
Lili.

473
00:24:23,530 --> 00:24:24,880
It's our home.

474
