500
00:25:38,670 --> 00:25:42,860
♪ Half my heart kept hidden ♪

501
00:25:43,050 --> 00:25:46,620
♪ Afraid you'll see right through me ♪

502
00:25:47,230 --> 00:25:51,110
♪ Does the fading light ♪

503
00:25:51,140 --> 00:25:55,200
♪ Decide it won't be whole? ♪

504
00:25:55,980 --> 00:26:00,020
♪ Half of my thoughts ♪

505
00:26:00,040 --> 00:26:03,800
♪ Bargain with solitude ♪

506
00:26:04,470 --> 00:26:08,300
♪ If you turn back to see ♪

507
00:26:08,320 --> 00:26:12,740
♪ Give back all the regret ♪

508
00:26:10,090 --> 00:26:10,960
They're on.

509
00:26:16,480 --> 00:26:17,140
I like them.

510
00:26:18,510 --> 00:26:19,240
Thank you.

511
00:26:23,830 --> 00:26:24,660
Oh no.

512
00:26:25,660 --> 00:26:28,000
I only ordered a cake for you today.

513
00:26:28,030 --> 00:26:29,750
I didn't get you a gift.

514
00:26:29,750 --> 00:26:30,440
I...

515
00:26:31,400 --> 00:26:31,900
Oh no.

516
00:26:31,930 --> 00:26:33,950
I only ordered a cake today.

517
00:26:34,160 --> 00:26:35,750
I didn't even get you a gift.

518
00:26:35,750 --> 00:26:37,210
