519
00:26:44,760 --> 00:26:46,060
Do you like me?

520
00:26:48,290 --> 00:26:48,980
Mm.

521
00:26:50,160 --> 00:26:51,160
I like you.

522
00:26:53,460 --> 00:26:54,700
I like you.

523
00:26:55,100 --> 00:26:56,510
I really like you.

524
00:26:59,940 --> 00:27:00,750
I know.

525
00:27:20,400 --> 00:27:23,120
♪ Burying regrets deep in the soil ♪

526
00:27:23,140 --> 00:27:26,300
