moving your things?

584
00:32:34,140 --> 00:32:34,940
No need.

585
00:32:35,000 --> 00:32:35,780
Shize will drive me there

586
00:32:35,780 --> 00:32:37,080
in a bit.

587
00:32:37,940 --> 00:32:38,980
Shize?

588
00:32:40,090 --> 00:32:41,090
So cheesy.

589
00:32:42,160 --> 00:32:42,960
I'll go pack my things.

590
00:32:42,960 --> 00:32:43,700
Bye-bye.

591
00:32:47,900 --> 00:32:49,230
What's wrong with Lili?

592
00:32:50,740 --> 00:32:52,160
Her dad is coming
for a surprise inspection.

593
00:32:52,160 --> 00:32:53,620
You know what to do, right?

594
00:33:06,940 --> 00:33:08,290
My dad came to Nanwu.

595
00:33:08,750 --> 00:33:11,160
I have to go back
to the guesthouse for a few days.

596
00:33:11,160 --> 00:33:12,820
Then let me treat him to a meal.

597
00:33:14,310 --> 00:33:15,860
Let's wait a bit?

598
00:33:16,700 --> 00:33:17,400
Then when can I

599
00:33:17,400 --> 00:33:18,590
meet him?

600
00:33:21,330 --> 00:33:22,990
Let's talk about it next time.

601
00:33:23,400 --> 00:33:24,930
You should understand him.

602
00:33:25,200 --> 00:33:26,790
After all, as a father,

603
00:33:26,790 --> 00:33:27,940
it's hard to accept

604
00:33:27,940 --> 00:33:29,340
giving his daughter away

605
00:33:29,400 --> 00:33:30,700
just like that.

606
00:33:32,510 --> 00:33:33,810
Then I can't accept

607
00:33:33,960 --> 00:33:35,290
giving you back either.

608
00:33:38,010 --> 00:33:38,530
Fu Shize,

609
00:33:38,530 --> 00:33:41,000
y-you're getting better and better
at this.

610
00:33:45,090 --> 00:33:46,750
Then when are you coming back?

611
00:33:48,440 --> 00:33:49,640
Depends on your performance.

612
00:33:49,640 --> 00:33:51,290
Maybe I won't come back.

613
00:33:52,940 --> 00:33:53,740
For example?

614
00:33:54,590 --> 00:33:55,550
Like...

615
00:33:57,140 --> 00:33:58,050
Let me ask you,

616
00:33:58,850 --> 00:33:59,750
who am I?

617
00:34:01,390 --> 00:34:02,190
Yun Lili.

618
00:34:03,030 --> 00:34:04,550
Who is Yun Lili?

619
00:34:05,200 --> 00:34:06,060
My girlfriend.

620
00:34:07,090 --> 00:34:08,550
Whose girlfriend?

621
00:34:11,460 --> 00:34:12,730
Fu Shize's wife.

622
00:34:15,300 --> 00:34:17,130
W-Who's your wife?

623
00:34:19,000 --> 00:34:19,790
Who else?

624
00:34:20,050 --> 00:34:21,179
Didn't you say that?

625
00:34:21,929 --> 00:34:23,179
I didn't say that.

626
00:34:43,409 --> 00:34:44,409
[Your dad has...]

627
00:34:45,840 --> 00:34:46,630
Uncle Yun.

628
00:34:47,030 --> 00:34:48,030
What brings you here?

629
00:34:48,030 --> 00:34:49,000
You should've told us in advance,

630
00:34:49,000 --> 00:34:49,960
so Lili could pick you up.

631
00:34:49,960 --> 00:34:50,190
No.

632
00:34:50,190 --> 00:34:50,630
Let me take it.

633
00:34:50,630 --> 00:34:51,090
No, don't bother.

634
00:34:51,090 --> 00:34:51,550
It's fine.

635
00:34:51,550 --> 00:34:52,630
You brought so many things.

636
00:34:52,630 --> 00:34:53,290
Look at you.

637
00:34:54,630 --> 00:34:56,020
It's Yun Li's mom.

638
00:34:56,120 --> 00:34:57,900
She insisted I bring them to her.

639
00:34:57,900 --> 00:34:58,690
Seriously.

640
00:34:59,190 --> 00:35:00,920
Let me pour you a glass of water.

641
00:35:01,090 --> 00:35:01,900
I don't know
if she's taking good care of herself

642
00:35:01,900 --> 00:35:02,530
living alone

643
00:35:02,530 --> 00:35:04,590
out here.

644
00:35:04,590 --> 00:35:05,340
Seriously.

645
00:35:05,340 --> 00:35:07,190
She always makes her family worry.

646
00:35:07,190 --> 00:35:08,630
You don't need to worry about her.

647
00:35:08,630 --> 00:35:10,560
Lili can take good care of herself.

648
00:35:11,960 --> 00:35:13,150
Your dad has arrived at the guesthouse.

649
00:35:13,150 --> 00:35:14,010
Come back ASAP.

650
00:35:14,960 --> 00:35:15,890
Have some water.

651
00:35:17,050 --> 00:35:18,300
You kids,

652
00:35:18,760 --> 00:35:20,260
which one of you
doesn't make your parents worry?

653
00:35:20,260 --> 00:35:21,690
You misunderstood me.

654
00:35:21,690 --> 00:35:22,940
Since I came to Nanwu,

655
00:35:22,940 --> 00:35:24,740
I haven't made my parents worry.

656
00:35:24,830 --> 00:35:26,430
You're just a smooth talker.

657
00:35:26,460 --> 00:35:27,260
Before I came,

658
00:35:27,260 --> 00:35:28,730
your mom specifically told me

659
00:35:28,730 --> 00:35:30,190
to tell you

660
00:35:30,660 --> 00:35:33,010
to find time to go home and visit.

661
00:35:33,340 --> 00:35:34,380
Look at you.

662
00:35:35,050 --> 00:35:37,150
You didn't even go home for the New Year.

663
00:35:37,150 --> 00:35:37,960
You don't know how much

664
00:35:37,960 --> 00:35:39,190
your parents miss you.

665
00:35:39,190 --> 00:35:40,690
I was just busy.

666
00:35:41,050 --> 00:35:43,380
You should think more about your parents.

667
00:35:43,880 --> 00:35:45,010
Where is Yun Li's room?

668
00:35:45,010 --> 00:35:46,070
I'll put the things inside first.

669
00:35:46,070 --> 00:35:46,690
Uncle.

670
00:35:46,690 --> 00:35:47,340
Well,

671
00:35:47,340 --> 00:35:48,860
Yun Li's room is over there,

672
00:35:48,860 --> 00:35:50,260
but we don't have the key.

673
00:35:51,220 --> 00:35:52,490
Then I'll call her.

674
00:36:01,490 --> 00:36:03,060
[Dad]

675
00:36:06,160 --> 00:36:06,970
Hello?

676
00:36:07,000 --> 00:36:08,460
Lili, where are you?

677
00:36:08,900 --> 00:36:10,340
Dad, I'm at school.

678
00:36:10,360 --> 00:36:11,030
Your mom

679
00:36:11,030 --> 00:36:11,550
specifically asked me

680
00:36:11,550 --> 00:36:12,530
to bring you 2 quilts.

681
00:36:12,530 --> 00:36:13,860
I'm at your place now.

682
00:36:14,000 --> 00:36:15,400
When are you coming back?

683
00:36:15,900 --> 00:36:17,430
I'm heading back right now.

684
00:36:19,000 --> 00:36:20,600
She's coming back right now.

685
00:36:25,090 --> 00:36:25,900
Hello, Uncle.

686
00:36:26,840 --> 00:36:28,760
W-Who are you?

687
00:36:29,130 --> 00:36:30,030
My name is Fu Zhengchu.

688
00:36:30,030 --> 00:36:31,260
I'm Lili's junior.

689
00:36:32,880 --> 00:36:34,760
Are you also from NUST?

690
00:36:34,760 --> 00:36:35,440
Yes.

691
00:36:35,700 --> 00:36:36,860
Do you live here too?

692
00:36:36,860 --> 00:36:37,670
Yes.

693
00:36:39,630 --> 00:36:40,400
No, no.

694
00:36:41,150 --> 00:36:42,860
This guesthouse is run by my sister.

695
00:36:42,860 --> 00:36:44,360
I just work here when I'm free,

696
00:36:44,360 --> 00:36:45,890
helping out occasionally.

697
00:36:47,500 --> 00:36:48,090
Hello, Uncle.

698
00:36:48,090 --> 00:36:49,420
My name is Xia Congsheng.

699
00:36:49,420 --> 00:36:49,900
Yes.

700
00:36:49,930 --> 00:36:52,100
I run this guesthouse.

701
00:36:52,860 --> 00:36:54,260
Would you like some tea?

702
00:36:54,310 --> 00:36:55,260
I have some Da Hong Pao
(Wuyi rock oolong).

703
00:36:55,260 --> 00:36:56,050
Let me get you some to try.

704
00:36:56,050 --> 00:36:56,550
No need.

705
00:36:56,550 --> 00:36:57,680
Water is fine for me.

706
00:36:58,500 --> 00:36:58,900
Uncle,

707
00:36:58,900 --> 00:37:00,650
there's a really beautiful lake nearby.

708
00:37:00,650 --> 00:37:01,090
And

709
00:37:01,090 --> 00:37:02,010
the weather is great today.

710
00:37:02,010 --> 00:37:02,980
How about I take you for a walk?

711
00:37:02,980 --> 00:37:03,510
No need.

712
00:37:03,510 --> 00:37:05,040
I'll just wait for her here.

713
00:37:05,300 --> 00:37:06,360
Then I'll go prepare some fruit for you.

714
00:37:06,360 --> 00:37:07,960
Our fruit is very fresh.

715
00:37:08,530 --> 00:37:09,360
You don't have to be so polite.

716
00:37:09,360 --> 00:37:10,090
Uncle Yun.

717
00:37:10,360 --> 00:37:11,140
You must be hungry.

718
00:37:11,140 --> 00:37:12,240
Let's go out to eat.

719
00:37:12,500 --> 00:37:15,300
Let's wait for Yun Li
to come back and eat together.

720
00:37:29,290 --> 00:37:30,890
What were you doing just now?

721
00:37:30,960 --> 00:37:31,860
Why did you tell him

722
00:37:31,860 --> 00:37:33,320
that I run the guesthouse?

723
00:37:33,400 --> 00:37:34,230
Exactly.

724
00:37:34,290 --> 00:37:34,730
I even said

725
00:37:34,730 --> 00:37:36,630
I didn't have the key to Yun Li's room.

726
00:37:36,630 --> 00:37:38,090
You guys didn't tell me.

727
00:37:45,090 --> 00:37:45,900
Lili.

728
00:37:47,820 --> 00:37:48,610
You're back.

729
00:37:49,590 --> 00:37:49,980
Lili,

730
00:37:49,980 --> 00:37:50,860
you're finally back.

731
00:37:50,860 --> 00:37:51,960
Your dad is coming on strong.

732
00:37:51,960 --> 00:37:53,190
I can barely handle it.

733
00:37:53,190 --> 00:37:54,520
Don't let him scare you.

734
00:37:54,550 --> 00:37:56,010
Our cover isn't blown yet.

735
00:37:56,280 --> 00:37:56,980
Thanks.

736
00:38:04,210 --> 00:38:04,800
Dad.

737
00:38:06,690 --> 00:38:07,500
Why...

738
00:38:08,050 --> 00:38:09,630
Why did you carry so much stuff?

739
00:38:09,630 --> 00:38:10,630
You should've told me

740
00:38:10,630 --> 00:38:11,800
so I could pick you up.

741
00:38:11,800 --> 00:38:13,050
I can walk by myself.

742
00:38:13,630 --> 00:38:14,620
Take these to your room.

743
00:38:14,620 --> 00:38:15,080
Come on.

744
00:38:15,140 --> 00:38:15,550
Dad,

745
00:38:15,550 --> 00:38:16,800
I have all these things.

746
00:38:16,800 --> 00:38:17,460
You don't need to give them to me.

747
00:38:17,460 --> 00:38:18,320
Take them back.

748
00:38:18,730 --> 00:38:20,730
Your mom prepared all these for you.

749
00:38:20,760 --> 00:38:22,090
Do you think I wanted to?

750
00:38:22,880 --> 00:38:23,610
Lead the way.

751
00:38:26,360 --> 00:38:26,960
Let's go.

752
00:38:50,440 --> 00:38:52,100
You're living alone out here,

753
00:38:52,530 --> 00:38:54,590
and your mom and I aren't by your side.

754
00:38:55,480 --> 00:38:57,190
Watch out for

755
00:38:57,660 --> 00:38:58,790
safety and hygiene.

756
00:38:59,150 --> 00:39:00,950
This room must be cleaned often.

757
00:39:01,940 --> 00:39:03,690
We clean it every day.

758
00:39:06,150 --> 00:39:07,750
The siblings also live here?

759
00:39:11,370 --> 00:39:13,200
When making friends out there,

760
00:39:13,230 --> 00:39:14,400
you must be careful.

761
00:39:14,840 --> 00:39:15,970
Don't bare your heart to someone

762
00:39:15,970 --> 00:39:17,660
right after meeting them,

763
00:39:17,820 --> 00:39:18,440
right?

764
00:39:28,040 --> 00:39:29,240
I already drank some.

765
00:39:33,130 --> 00:39:34,340
Have you eaten?

766
00:39:34,500 --> 00:39:36,160
I'll take you to get some food.

767
00:39:38,330 --> 00:39:39,700
Tell me the truth.

768
00:39:40,880 --> 00:39:41,930
Are you and that guy

769
00:39:41,930 --> 00:39:42,990
still dating?

770
00:39:55,860 --> 00:39:57,520
Invite him to dinner tonight.

771
00:40:09,500 --> 00:40:10,300
Hello, Uncle.

772
00:40:10,630 --> 00:40:11,690
My name is Fu Shize.

773
00:40:13,420 --> 00:40:15,030
I heard from Yun Li

774
00:40:15,480 --> 00:40:16,810
that you are from Nanwu.

775
00:40:17,170 --> 00:40:17,650
Yes.

776
00:40:18,710 --> 00:40:19,570
How old are you?

777
00:40:19,730 --> 00:40:20,660
I'm 24 this year.

778
00:40:22,300 --> 00:40:24,250
What do your parents do?

779
00:40:24,650 --> 00:40:25,910
Are they also in Nanwu?

780
00:40:27,000 --> 00:40:29,030
They work at a research institute now.

781
00:40:29,030 --> 00:40:29,960
They travel a lot

782
00:40:30,170 --> 00:40:31,370
and rarely come back.

783
00:40:32,070 --> 00:40:34,260
So they are senior intellectuals.

784
00:40:34,500 --> 00:40:35,510
Highly educated.

785
00:40:35,510 --> 00:40:36,420
That's great.

786
00:40:39,690 --> 00:40:40,550
What about you?

787
00:40:40,660 --> 00:40:42,150
He did his undergrad

788
00:40:42,180 --> 00:40:43,360
at XUST.

789
00:40:43,630 --> 00:40:44,500
He was also Nanwu's

790
00:40:44,500 --> 00:40:46,760
top scorer in the college entrance exam.

791
00:40:47,800 --> 00:40:50,440
Then you should be doing
your master's now.

792
00:40:50,950 --> 00:40:52,030
He skipped grades.

793
00:40:52,340 --> 00:40:55,140
He's in a combined
master's and doctoral program.

794
00:40:56,410 --> 00:40:57,870
Let him speak for himself.

795
00:41:01,590 --> 00:41:02,650
Yes, Uncle.

796
00:41:02,670 --> 00:41:04,270
I'm doing my PhD at XUST.

797
00:41:06,860 --> 00:41:08,790
You are the same age as my daughter.

798
00:41:08,860 --> 00:41:10,960
So you haven't graduated yet?

799
00:41:12,300 --> 00:41:12,900
Not yet.

800
00:41:14,000 --> 00:41:15,730
I'm taking a break from school.

801
00:41:26,380 --> 00:41:27,070
Dad.

802
00:41:28,650 --> 00:41:29,210
Uncle.

803
00:41:29,240 --> 00:41:29,900
D-Dad.

804
00:41:29,930 --> 00:41:31,240
What's wrong all of a sudden?

805
00:41:31,240 --> 00:41:31,950
Uncle.

806
00:41:31,980 --> 00:41:33,090
How can I still eat?

807
00:41:33,510 --> 00:41:33,840
Wait, wait.

808
00:41:33,840 --> 00:41:35,030
Why can't you eat?

809
00:41:35,030 --> 00:41:35,730
Uncle.

810
00:41:35,880 --> 00:41:36,640
What do you think?

811
00:41:36,640 --> 00:41:37,690
Why all of a sudden...

812
00:41:37,690 --> 00:41:39,150
This is for you and Auntie.

813
00:41:39,400 --> 00:41:40,260
Please take it.

814
00:41:40,460 --> 00:41:41,900
Keep it for yourself.

815
00:41:42,400 --> 00:41:43,010
Dad!

816
00:41:47,230 --> 00:41:48,360
Aren't you leaving?

817
00:42:00,480 --> 00:42:00,980
Dad!

818
00:42:09,760 --> 00:42:11,000
Wasn't everything fine at first?

819
00:42:11,000 --> 00:42:11,760
Dad, you...

820
00:42:11,760 --> 00:42:12,400
I-I really...

821
00:42:12,400 --> 00:42:13,800
I don't understand, Dad.

822
00:42:14,780 --> 00:42:16,780
What kind of boyfriend did you find?

823
00:42:16,780 --> 00:42:18,350
He can't even finish his studies.

824
00:42:18,350 --> 00:42:19,350
He didn't quit

825
00:42:19,480 --> 00:42:20,670
because he couldn't study well.

826
00:42:20,670 --> 00:42:22,260
He has his reasons.

827
00:42:22,260 --> 00:42:23,280
What reasons?

828
00:42:25,550 --> 00:42:26,400
Yun Li,

829
00:42:27,230 --> 00:42:28,050
why did he suspend his studies?

830
00:42:28,050 --> 00:42:29,580
You don't even know, do you?

831
00:42:30,150 --> 00:42:31,280
I don't need to know.

832
00:42:32,430 --> 00:42:33,630
That's his business.

833
00:42:33,630 --> 00:42:34,690
His business?

834
00:42:36,050 --> 00:42:37,340
Then... Then...

835
00:42:37,340 --> 00:42:38,530
Then why are you two dating?

836
00:42:38,530 --> 00:42:40,340
Whether he suspends
his studies is his choice.

837
00:42:40,340 --> 00:42:41,260
Whether I date him

838
00:42:41,260 --> 00:42:41,960
is my choice.

839
00:42:41,960 --> 00:42:44,020
Can you stop interfering from now on?

840
00:42:54,000 --> 00:42:55,060
I won't interfere.

841
00:42:55,130 --> 00:42:55,940
I won't interfere.

842
00:42:55,940 --> 00:42:56,840
I won't interfere at all.

843
00:42:56,840 --> 00:42:57,550
Wait!

844
00:42:58,630 --> 00:43:00,710
I won't interfere
with anything from now on!

845
00:43:00,710 --> 00:43:02,050
Where are you going?

846
00:43:02,340 --> 00:43:03,200
To the airport!

847
00:43:03,440 --> 00:43:05,050
Going to the airport so late at night?
